Package: MoCo
Title: Motion-Controlled Estimation of Group Differences in Brain Phenotypes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Brain Research in Imaging Statistics Kit",
        email = "thebrisklab@users.noreply.github.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Implements nonparametric one-step estimators for group-specific
    brain-phenotype means and contrasts while accounting for motion-related
    selection. Nuisance functions can be estimated with Super Learner, and
    conditional motion densities can be modeled with highly adaptive lasso,
    log-normal generalized linear models, or generalized additive models for
    location, scale, and shape. Simultaneous confidence bands provide
    family-wise error-rate control across multiple outcomes.
